error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
  --> crates/monty/src/../tests/heap_owner_compile_fail_cases/cases.rs:65:28
   |
64 |     let mut root = None;
   |         -------- `root` declared here, outside of the closure body
65 |     owner.activate(|state| root = Some(Value::Ref(state.heap.allocate(HeapData::List(List::new(Vec::new()))))));
   |                     -----  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `state` escapes the closure body here
   |                     |
   |                     `state` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
